---
import Figure from "../ProjectFigure.astro";
import Video from "../ProjectVideo.astro";
import { asset } from "../../data/profile";
import "../../styles/surgery.css";
const clips = [
  { id: "bench-prototype", tag: "Lab prototype" },
  { id: "camera-guidance", tag: "Actuator · Camera" },
  { id: "camera-assembly", tag: "Camera capsule" },
  { id: "instrument-motion", tag: "Instrument" },
];
---
<span id="abstract" class="section-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<section class="project-section surgery-section" id="background" aria-labelledby="background-title">
  <h2 id="background-title">Background</h2>
  <p class="surgery-lead">In minimally invasive surgery, the surgeon works through small incisions and sees inside the body only through a laparoscopic camera, which an assistant holds and moves.</p>
  <div class="surgery-single"><Figure id="surgical-workspace" quiet /></div>
</section>

<section class="project-section surgery-section" id="problems" aria-labelledby="problems-title">
  <h2 id="problems-title">Problem</h2>
  <p class="surgery-lead">The confined workspace limits where the camera can look, and smoke, fog, and fluids can cover the lens.</p>
  <div class="surgery-pair">
    <Figure id="restricted-viewpoints" quiet tag="Restricted viewpoints" />
    <Figure id="obscured-view" quiet tag="Obscured view" />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="project-section surgery-section" id="innovations" aria-labelledby="innovations-title">
  <h2 id="innovations-title">Methodology</h2>
  <p class="surgery-lead">Three directions toward a clear, steady view: magnetic camera actuation, bioinspired lens care, and AI visual feedback.</p>

  <div class="surgery-step" id="method">
    <h3>Magnetic camera actuation</h3>
    <p>A robot-mounted actuator outside the body moves and turns a camera inside it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="surgery-wide"><Figure id="surgery-mechanism" quiet /></div>
  <div class="surgery-pair surgery-clips">
    {clips.map(clip => <div class="surgery-clip"><Video id={clip.id} /><p class="media-tag" aria-hidden="true">{clip.tag}</p></div>)}
  </div>

  <div class="surgery-step" id="cleaning">
    <h3>Bioinspired lens care</h3>
    <p>Modeled on the human eye, a robotic eyelid and a soft nozzle are being designed to keep the lens clear.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="surgery-wide"><Figure id="eye-concept" quiet /></div>
  <div class="surgery-pair">
    <Figure id="eyelid-concept" quiet tag="Robotic eyelid" />
    <Figure id="soft-nozzle" quiet tag="Soft nozzle" />
  </div>
  <div class="surgery-wide"><Figure id="cleaning-control" quiet /></div>

  <div class="surgery-step" id="visual-ai">
    <h3>AI visual feedback</h3>
    <p>AI models locate the tools, detect tool–tissue contact, and add 3D feedback to the 2D view, tested in simulated training.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="surgery-wide"><Figure id="ai-pipeline" quiet /></div>
  <div class="surgery-wide surgery-spatial"><Figure id="spatial-feedback" quiet /><p class="surgery-view-tags" aria-hidden="true"><span>2D view</span><span>3D context</span></p></div>
</section>

<section class="project-section surgery-citation" id="publications" aria-labelledby="publications-title">
  <h2 id="publications-title">Citation</h2>
  <p class="surgery-reference">Liu, S., Tan, Y., &amp; Li, S. (2025). <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.02233">Learning Spatial Awareness for Laparoscopic Surgery with AI Assisted Visual Feedback</a>. arXiv:2511.02233. <a href="https://arxiv.org/html/2511.02233v1">HTML version</a></p>
  <p class="surgery-fine">AI figures are from this paper, reproduced under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. · <a href={asset("accessibility/#surgery-media")}>Accessibility &amp; media credits</a> · <a href={asset("#lab-projects")}>All projects</a></p>
</section>
